OL,3,AWho could be behind the Binance hack
OL,4,Aand what we know so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinance, the world's largest crypto
OL,7,Fexchange, has been hit by what is
OL,8,Fbelieved to be the largest crypto hack
OL,9,Fever at $6.3bn (#4.7bn).
OL,11,FCrypto is a type of digital asset which
OL,12,Fdoes not exist physically like cash or
OL,13,Fcoins. Instead, people use digital
OL,14,Fwallets on their smartphones or
OL,15,Fcomputers to access and manage it.
OL,17,FBinance said the hackers raided its
OL,18,Fdigital assets in part by conning a
OL,19,Fcompany engineer through a fake job
OL,20,Finterview.
